title: Remove deprecated migration::remove_storage_prefix
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    Removes deprecated `migration::remove_storage_prefix` as part of #11561.

    Migrates all in-repo callers to `clear_storage_prefix(..., None, None)` (equivalent behavior). No external usage remains.

    Does not close #11561.

    ## Integration

    ```diff
    - remove_storage_prefix(module, item, hash);
    + let _ = clear_storage_prefix(module, item, hash, None, None);
    ```
    Review Notes

    - 5 files: remove API in frame-support, update migrations in scheduler, parachain-system, purchase, yet-another-parachain test runtime
    - cargo check passed locally for frame-support, pallet-scheduler, cumulus-pallet-parachain-system, polkadot-runtime-common
crates:
- name: cumulus-pallet-parachain-system
  bump: major
- name: yet-another-parachain-runtime
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-runtime-common
  bump: major
- name: pallet-scheduler
  bump: major
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
